  "description": "NOC Device Health — 7 PNET IOSv routers. Memory utilization (percent, 7-series timeseries), ICMP ping stat tiles (DOWN=red, UP=green), SNMP agent availability tiles (1=available/green, 2=unavailable/red, 0=unknown/orange). CPU utilization panels were intentionally deferred: Zabbix's dependent `#1: CPU utilization` items on these hosts expose a current lastvalue (verified via item.get) but history.get/trend.get return empty — the master `system.cpu.walk` isn't producing persistent dependent-item outputs yet. Add a CPU timeseries row once Zabbix history populates. Thresholds: Memory orange >=70, red >=90. Items discovered via Grafana→Zabbix datasource resource proxy on 2026-10-04."
